      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VICTA GRAHAM (3) is worth forgiving for his last effort when fifth (30.31) at Murray Bridge over 530m. Form at the trip sound including three wins. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Can discover winning form. PAW LEON (7) has some solid form under his belt and proved too strong last time to win by 3.5 lengths at Angle Park in a handy 30.77 beating Booterstown. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Likely to be in the finish. ALGORITHM (1) found the going tougher last start when finishing 4th over 400m at this track. Was a winner the start prior in easier at Murray Bridge. The form out of his last race has been franked. Has ability and is one of the better chances. BOOM BOOM JACK (4) is a last start winner and can go on with it.",
